# The Paladin's last job node: a thrown hammer that hunts down one enemy after
# another, leaving a shockwave on each.
#
# GMS charges it rather than cooling it down -- one hammer every twelve
# seconds, three held at most, thrown singly or all at once. Nothing here holds
# charges, and it comes to the same thing over a fight: the cooldown is the
# twelve seconds a hammer takes to prepare, not the 2.5 the readout states.
#
# The four it tracks are reached at once rather than one after another, which
# is what a swing here can say. The shockwave reaches six of its own, so it is
# a side strike rather than an extra hit -- an extra hit shares the swing's
# reach by construction. It rides the cast with no wait of its own: this is
# swung once a cooldown, so every swing is meant to set one off.
#
# 570ms is the pack's own q, the only leftover there that reads as a cast
# length. GMS publishes no frame data for this one.
#
# Dropped: throwing several hammers on the directional keys, Omnia Mode, and
# the whole of the right-click toggle -- key presses, all of them.
name: "Mighty Mjolnir"
description:
  "Summon the hammer of an ancient god, then hurl it straight toward your "
  "enemies. Each successful hit creates a powerful shockwave. The hammers "
  "track down the enemy with the highest HP, aside from the one it had just "
  "attacked. All of the hammers' attacks are unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_BLUNT
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_BLUNT
base_delay_ms: 570
cooldown_seconds: 12.0
max_enemies: 4
lines: 6
base {
  skill_pct: 2.45
  crit_rate: 0.50
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
side_strike {
  label: "Shockwave"
  max_enemies: 6
  lines: 9
  casts: 4
  base { skill_pct: 2.86 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.11 }
}
